 hydras, Orat. iii. 58 fin. eels, Ep. Aeg. 7 fin. cuttlefish, Orat. iii. 59. gnats, de Decr. 14 init Orat. iii. 59. init. beetles, Orat. iii. fin. leeches, Hist. Ar. 65 init. de Fug. 4. [swine, Or. ii. 1.] In many of these instances the allusion is to Scripture. On names given to heretics in general, vid. the Alphabetum bestialitatis hereticae ex Patrum Symbolis, in the Calvinismus bestiarum religio attributed to Raynaudus and printed in the Apopompaeus of his works. Vid. on the principle of such applications infr. Orat. iii. 18."},{"id":"026e2541bed1","v":"npnf.athanasius.orationes_contra_arianos","w":"athanasius.orationes_contra_arianos","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":27,"p":[6,6],"r":[1,17],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. i. 17; 1 Pet. iii. 22."},{"id":"17206df7305b","v":"npnf.athanasius.historia_arianorum","w":"athanasius.historia_arianorum","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":4,"p":[3,3],"r":[2,22],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"[351 a.d.] Cf. 2 Pet. ii. 22."},{"id":"b7bf09b2b6f0","v":"npnf.athanasius.vita_antonii","w":"athanasius.vita_antonii","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":1,"p":[75,75],"r":[1,4],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Cf. de Incar. 54. 3 ; 2 Pet. i. 4."},{"id":"4f525acc0e9e","v":"npnf.athanasius.epistulae","w":"athanasius.epistulae","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":31,"p":[0,0],"r":[3,16],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. iii. 16."},{"id":"22ce1cc9a54d","v":"npnf.athanasius.epistulae","w":"athanasius.epistulae","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":42,"p":[5,5],"r":[1,4],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. i. 4, above, p. 65, note 5."},{"id":"1eb8cfd0795a","v":"npnf.athanasius.epistulae","w":"athanasius.epistulae","a":"athanasius_von_alexandrien","s":43,"p":[3,3],"r":[1,4],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. i. 4."},{"id":"e4b45271c143","v":"anf.irenaeus.adversus_haereses","w":"irenaeus.adversus_haereses","a":"irenaus_von_lyon","s":95,"p":[3,3],"r":[2,19],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"[2 Pet. ii. 19.]"},{"id":"17782a1ed99d","v":"anf.irenaeus.adversus_haereses","w":"irenaeus.adversus_haereses","a":"irenaus_von_lyon","s":160,"p":[1,1],"r":[3,8],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. iii. 8."},{"id":"77459510a833","v":"anf.irenaeus.adversus_haereses","w":"irenaeus.adversus_haereses","a":"irenaus_von_lyon","s":165,"p":[2,2],"r":[3,8],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. iii. 8."},{"id":"02f844c106f8","v":"anf.justin.dialogus","w":"justin.dialogus","a":"justin_der_martyrer","s":81,"p":[0,0],"r":[3,8],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"Ps. xc. 4; 2 Pet. iii. 8."},{"id":"3ee0608972a9","v":"anf.cyprian.ad_fortunatum","w":"cyprian.ad_fortunatum","a":"cyprian_von_karthago","s":4,"p":[19,19],"r":[2,16],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"[Confirmed in the New Testament, as if on purpose to silence unbelief (2 Pet. ii. 16). Cyprian is one of the,few divines who note the light thrown on Balaam's inspiration by the fact that even a dumb beast might be made to speak words, not of his own will.]"},{"id":"ae8800c48a06","v":"anf.cyprian.epistulae","w":"cyprian.epistulae","a":"cyprian_von_karthago","s":7,"p":[3,3],"r":[2,13],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"[Compare, in former letters, similar complaints, to which brie[ notes are subjoined. And mark the honest simplicity o( these confessions. 2 Peter ii. 13, 14, 15.]"},{"id":"00e145d382a8","v":"npnf.hilarius.de_synodis","w":"hilarius.de_synodis","a":"hilarius_von_poitiers","s":1,"p":[113,113],"r":[1,4],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"The flesh , without ceasin to be truly flesh, is represented as becoming divine like the Word. That is, the humanity becomes so endowed with power, and knowledge, and hoiness through the unction of the Holy Ghost that its natural properties are \"deified.\" These and similar phrases are freely used byt the Fathers of the fourth century, and may be compared with John I. 14, and 2 Pet. I. 4."},{"id":"c3ba02cfb90f","v":"npnf.hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","w":"hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","a":"hieronymus","s":1,"p":[51,51],"r":[1,4],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. i. 4."},{"id":"b7219d05cb87","v":"npnf.hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","w":"hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","a":"hieronymus","s":1,"p":[51,51],"r":[2,9],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. ii. 9 sq."},{"id":"6aacaa455b68","v":"npnf.hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","w":"hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","a":"hieronymus","s":1,"p":[51,51],"r":[3,3],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. iii. 3."},{"id":"ea3a4038a4bc","v":"npnf.hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","w":"hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","a":"hieronymus","s":2,"p":[7,7],"r":[2,9],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. ii. 9."},{"id":"6481f88c6df6","v":"npnf.hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","w":"hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","a":"hieronymus","s":2,"p":[7,7],"r":[2,17],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. ii. 17, 2 Pet. ii. 18."},{"id":"ba33764fc330","v":"npnf.hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","w":"hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","a":"hieronymus","s":2,"p":[7,7],"r":[2,18],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. ii. 17, 2 Pet. ii. 18."},{"id":"230d4e95c2a7","v":"npnf.hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","w":"hieronymus.adversus_iovinianum","a":"hieronymus","s":2,"p":[40,40],"r":[1,4],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. i. 4."},{"id":"57bb621e0816","v":"npnf.gregor_gr.regula_pastoralis","w":"gregor_gr.regula_pastoralis","a":"gregor_der_grosse","s":25,"p":[2,2],"r":[2,16],"k":"quotation","m":"editionCitation","c":"high","cited":"2 Pet. ii. 16"},{"id":"8